; SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later
; Copyright (C) 2026 Todd Houg
;
; ROCKFALL.Z88 -- a vector space rock shooter for CADzilla (z88dk z80asm,
; cz88gfx 1.5, 8080)
;
; Fly a small ship through a field of drifting rocks and shoot them. A
; large rock breaks into two medium ones, a medium one into three small
; ones, and a small one is destroyed. There are always a few large or
; medium rocks about: when they run short another drifts in, and when a
; wave's quota of them is spent the next wave starts. Now and then a
; raider crosses the screen and fires at the ship, aimed, and from wave 2
; leading it. Hitting a rock, the raider or its shots costs a ship; there
; are five, and a bonus ship every 10,000 points. Each wave is harder:
; more rocks at once, faster, and raiders that come sooner, fire faster
; and aim closer.
;
;   W  thrust        A  turn left        D  turn right      space  fire
;   P  pause         Q, ESC or ^C  back to CP/M
;
; The keys come from the CP/M console (BDOS 6), which has no key-up, so a
; key works for HOLDT/HOLDR frames after each character and the
; terminal's auto-repeat keeps it going while it is held.
;
; Drawing. Everything on the playfield is drawn in EOR (XOR) with the
; area clip on: each frame an object is drawn again where it was, which
; erases it, then moved and drawn anew. Shapes are RPLG polygons from
; RFTAB.INC (tools/mktables.py), so the 8080 sends a move and a fixed
; list of deltas, with no per-vertex sums. An object near an edge is also
; drawn at the far side, and the clip trims both, so it slides across the
; wrap. The score, wave, ships left and all messages are on the overlay,
; out of the XOR picture's way.
;
; Speed. Drawing is mostly the 8080 feeding the ACRTC's FIFO, so DRAW1
; sends its words with FSEND: wait until the 8-word write FIFO is empty,
; then fill it with no status check between words (about 45 T-states a
; word, against 140 through CZPUTW).
;
; Timing. The board has no timer, so each frame ends with a GWAIT and a
; delay of FRAMED loops less OBJK for every object drawn or erased, which
; keeps the speed roughly even until the delay runs out; a crowded screen
; then slows down. Tuned in altairsim under work/cadzilla-real.toml (2 MHz,
; draw_rate = "real"): about 18 frames a second on wave 1.
;
; Real-chip notes: no PAINT, ELPS, arcs or AREA stop modes. FSWAIT and
; FSBLK are the only code here that touches the ACRTC's ports, and they
; keep cz88gfx 1.5's A1 rule (see the comment above FSWAIT).
;
; Build on the host, then R ROCKFALL.COM onto the disk and run it:
;   software/z88dk/rockfall/build.sh
;
        INCLUDE "CZ88GFX.INC"
;
; ---- tuning ----
;
FRAMED  EQU     2400            ;delay loops a frame with nothing drawn
OBJK    EQU     80              ;fewer loops per object drawn or erased
HOLDT   EQU     4               ;frames a W keeps thrusting
HOLDR   EQU     2               ;frames an A or D keeps turning
FCOOLV  EQU     3               ;frames between shots
SHOTL   EQU     45              ;frames a shot lives
RSHL    EQU     70              ;frames a raider shot lives
VMAXH   EQU     8               ;ship speed limit, pixels a frame
KBASE   EQU     8               ;large rock speed on wave 1, 1/4 pixels a frame
KSMALL  EQU     6               ;added for a small rock
KMAX    EQU     32              ;rock speed limit
DEADF   EQU     30              ;frames from the last ship lost to GAME OVER
INVULF  EQU     56              ;frames a new ship can't be hit (3 s),
CLRAD   EQU     100             ;unless nothing is this near it
QBASE   EQU     4               ;large rocks in wave n: n+QBASE,
QMAX    EQU     14              ;but no more than QMAX
TOPD    EQU     25              ;frames before another big rock comes in
KMED    EQU     3               ;added for a medium rock
RSPDV   EQU     0400H           ;raider speed, 8.8
RLEFTV  EQU     256             ;frames to cross the screen at RSPDV
RVYV    EQU     0100H           ;raider vertical drift, 8.8
RTURN   EQU     30              ;frames between raider course changes
RTBASE  EQU     300             ;frames between raiders on wave 1
RTSTEP  EQU     25              ;fewer each wave
RTMIN   EQU     100             ;but no fewer than this
RFBASE  EQU     30              ;frames between raider shots, less 2 a wave
RFMIN   EQU     12
PRESSH  EQU     2               ;pressure step every PRESSH*256 frames
PRESMX  EQU     6               ;pressure steps a wave, at most
NSTARS  EQU     80
BOXSZ   EQU     2               ;shots and debris: 3x3 boxes
;
NPSHOT  EQU     8               ;table sizes (player shots in flight)
NRSHOT  EQU     3
NROCKS  EQU     36
NDEBR   EQU     24
;
; An object record, 16 bytes. ACT is the kind, 0 = free, plus DRAWN
; while it is on the screen. X and Y are 16.8 fixed point (the fraction
; byte first), VX and VY signed 8.8. SHP is its RPLG shape (0: a box),
; AUX its radius (0..3: no wrap ghosts). LIFE counts down to its end (0:
; it lives until hit).
;
R_ACT   EQU     0
R_XF    EQU     1
R_X     EQU     2
R_YF    EQU     4
R_Y     EQU     5
R_VX    EQU     7
R_VY    EQU     9
R_SHP   EQU     11
R_COL   EQU     13
R_LIFE  EQU     14
R_AUX   EQU     15
RSZ     EQU     16
;
K_ROCK  EQU     1
K_SHOT  EQU     2
K_DEB   EQU     3
K_RAID  EQU     4
K_SHIP  EQU     5
K_RSH   EQU     6
DRAWN   EQU     80H
;
BDOS    EQU     0005H
DIRIO   EQU     6               ;direct console I/O: E = 0FFH reads, no wait
PSTRING EQU     9
CR      EQU     0DH
LF      EQU     0AH
ESC     EQU     1BH
CTLC    EQU     03H
;
        ORG     0100H
;
START:  LXI     H,0             ;keep CCP's stack, run on our own
        DAD     SP
        SHLD    OLDSP
        LXI     SP,STACK
        LXI     D,MSGHI
        CALL    PRINT
        GINIT   CZM1K
        GOVPAL  96,255,128      ;the overlay: a light green
        GOVON
        GFONT   CZF11
        CALL    CLRALL
        CALL    NEWSCR
        CALL    TITLSC
;
; The frame loop
;
FRAME:  XRA     A
        STA     NDRAW
        LHLD    FRAMEC
        INX     H
        SHLD    FRAMEC
        CALL    KEYS
        LDA     GSTATE
        ORA     A
        CNZ     SHIPST
        LXI     H,PSHOTS
        MVI     B,NPSHOT
        CALL    STEPAR
        LXI     H,ROCKS
        MVI     B,NROCKS
        CALL    STEPAR
        CALL    RAIDST
        LXI     H,RSHOTS
        MVI     B,NRSHOT
        CALL    STEPAR
        LXI     H,DEBR
        MVI     B,NDEBR
        CALL    STEPAR
        LDA     GSTATE
        ORA     A
        JZ      FRM2
        CALL    COLLID
        CALL    RAIDCK
        CALL    PRESCK
FRM2:   CALL    ROCKCK
        CALL    HUDUPD
        GWAIT
        JZ      FRM3
        GABORT                  ;a command error: clear it and go on
        MVI     A,1
        STA     LCOL
FRM3:   CALL    PACE
        JMP     FRAME
;
EXIT:   GCLS    0
        GOVCLS
        GOVOFF
        LXI     D,MSGBYE
        CALL    PRINT
        LHLD    OLDSP
        SPHL
        RET
;
;
; ================= keys =================
;
; KEYS -- take every waiting key (up to 8). On the title screen, space
; starts a game; in a game, W A D set their hold counts, space asks for
; a shot and P pauses. ESC, ^C and Q quit everywhere.
;
KEYS:   MVI     A,8
        STA     KCNT
KEYLP:  MVI     C,DIRIO
        MVI     E,0FFH
        CALL    BDOS
        ORA     A
        RZ
        CPI     'a'             ;upper case
        JC      KEY1
        CPI     'z'+1
        JNC     KEY1
        SUI     20H
KEY1:   CALL    ISQ
        JZ      EXIT
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     GSTATE
        ORA     A
        MOV     A,B
        JNZ     KEYPL
        CPI     ' '
        JNZ     KEYNX
        JMP     STARTG          ;a new game: the rest can wait
KEYPL:  CPI     'W'
        JNZ     KEY2
        MVI     A,HOLDT
        STA     KTHR
        JMP     KEYNX
KEY2:   CPI     'A'
        JNZ     KEY3
        MVI     A,HOLDR
        STA     KLEFT
        XRA     A
        STA     KRIGHT
        JMP     KEYNX
KEY3:   CPI     'D'
        JNZ     KEY4
        MVI     A,HOLDR
        STA     KRIGHT
        XRA     A
        STA     KLEFT
        JMP     KEYNX
KEY4:   CPI     ' '
        JNZ     KEY5
        MVI     A,1
        STA     KFIRE
        JMP     KEYNX
KEY5:   CPI     'P'
        CZ      PAUSE
KEYNX:  LDA     KCNT
        DCR     A
        STA     KCNT
        JNZ     KEYLP
        RET
;
ISQ:    CPI     ESC             ;Z if A is a quit key
        RZ
        CPI     CTLC
        RZ
        CPI     'Q'
        RZ
        CPI     'q'
        RET
;
; PAUSE -- until the next key (a quit key quits)
;
PAUSE:  CALL    OVON1
        GTATTR  4,0,0
        GTPOS   404,360
        GTEXT   "PAUSED"
        CALL    OVOFF1
PAUSLP: MVI     C,DIRIO
        MVI     E,0FFH
        CALL    BDOS
        ORA     A
        JZ      PAUSLP
        CALL    ISQ
        JZ      EXIT
        GOVCLS
        MVI     A,0FH
        STA     HUDDRT
        XRA     A
        STA     KTHR
        STA     KLEFT
        STA     KRIGHT
        STA     KFIRE
        RET
;
PRINT:  MVI     C,PSTRING
        JMP     BDOS
;
; DELAY -- spin HL times, 24 T-states a time
;
DELAY:  MOV     A,H
        ORA     L
        RZ
DLP:    DCX     H
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     L
        JNZ     DLP
        RET
;
; PACE -- the end of a frame: FRAMED less OBJK per object drawn
;
PACE:   LXI     H,FRAMED
        LXI     D,0-OBJK
        LDA     NDRAW
        ORA     A
        JZ      PC2
PCL:    DAD     D
        DCR     A
        JNZ     PCL
PC2:    MOV     A,H
        ORA     A
        JM      PCX
        JMP     DELAY
PCX:    RET
;
;
; ================= game states =================
;
; TITLSC -- the title over drifting rocks
;
TITLSC: XRA     A
        STA     GSTATE
        MVI     A,3             ;rocks drifting behind the title
        STA     MINBIG
        MVI     A,0FH
        STA     HUDDRT
        CALL    OVON1
        GTATTR  8,0,0
        GTPOS   224,520
        GTEXT   "ROCKFALL"
        CALL    HELPTX
        JMP     OVOFF1
;
HELPTX: GTATTR  2,0,0
        GTPOS   152,400
        GTEXT   "W THRUST   A LEFT   D RIGHT   SPACE FIRE"
        GTPOS   206,340
        GTEXT   "SPACE TO PLAY    P PAUSE    Q QUIT"
        RET
;
; STARTG -- a new game. The frame count so far (how long the player
; took to press space) stirs the random numbers.
;
STARTG: LHLD    FRAMEC
        XCHG
        LHLD    SEED
        MOV     A,L
        XRA     E
        MOV     L,A
        MOV     A,H
        XRA     D
        MOV     H,A
        ORA     L
        JNZ     STG1
        INX     H
STG1:   SHLD    SEED
        CALL    CLRALL
        CALL    NEWSCR
        GOVCLS
        XRA     A
        STA     SCORE
        STA     SCORE+1
        STA     SCORE+2
        STA     WAVE
        STA     TOPT
        MVI     A,5
        STA     LIVES
        MVI     A,0FH
        STA     HUDDRT
        MVI     A,1
        STA     GSTATE
        CALL    NEXTWV
        JMP     SPAWNC
;
; GAMEOV -- the last ship is gone: keep the high score, say so
;
GAMEOV: XRA     A
        STA     GSTATE
        STA     SSTATE
        LXI     H,SCORE+2       ;compare, high byte first
        LXI     D,HISC+2
        MVI     B,3
GOLP:   LDAX    D
        CMP     M
        JC      GONEW
        JNZ     GOTXT
        DCX     H
        DCX     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     GOLP
        JMP     GOTXT
GONEW:  LHLD    SCORE
        SHLD    HISC
        LDA     SCORE+2
        STA     HISC+2
GOTXT:  GOVCLS
        MVI     A,0FH
        STA     HUDDRT
        CALL    OVON1
        GTATTR  6,0,0
        GTPOS   269,520
        GTEXT   "GAME OVER"
        CALL    HELPTX
        JMP     OVOFF1
;
; NEWSCR -- clear the frame and scatter the stars (drawn once, in
; replace mode; the XOR drawing passes over them unharmed)
;
NEWSCR: GCLS    0
        GMODE   0
        MVI     B,NSTARS
NSLP:   PUSH    B
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     3
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        LXI     H,STARC
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,M
        CALL    CZCOL
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,H
        ANI     3
        MOV     H,A             ;X 0..1023
        CALL    RANDY           ;Y 0..766
        CALL    CZDOT
        POP     B
        DCR     B
        JNZ     NSLP
        GMODE   OMEOR+AMCLIP
        MVI     A,1             ;the colour cache is stale
        STA     LCOL
        RET
;
; CLRALL -- free every object
;
CLRALL: LXI     H,ARRBEG
        LXI     B,ARREND-ARRBEG
CLLP:   MVI     M,0
        INX     H
        DCX     B
        MOV     A,B
        ORA     C
        JNZ     CLLP
        RET
;
;
; ================= waves, rocks, pressure =================
;
; A wave has a quota of large rocks, MIN(WAVE+QBASE, QMAX). It starts by
; letting MINBIG+1 of them in; after that ROCKCK lets one more in, TOPD
; frames apart, whenever fewer than MINBIG large or medium rocks are
; left. Once the quota is spent, the next wave starts as soon as the big
; rocks run short again, so the screen never runs out of them. MINBIG
; is 2 on wave 1 and grows by one every other wave, to 5.
;
; NEXTWV -- the next wave
;
NEXTWV: LDA     WAVE
        INR     A
        STA     WAVE
        XRA     A
        STA     PRESS
        LXI     H,0
        SHLD    PRESSC
        LDA     WAVE
        ADI     QBASE
        CPI     QMAX+1
        JC      NW1
        MVI     A,QMAX
NW1:    STA     WQUOTA
        LDA     WAVE            ;MINBIG = 2 + (WAVE-1)/2, 5 at most
        DCR     A
        ORA     A
        RAR
        ADI     2
        CPI     6
        JC      NW2
        MVI     A,5
NW2:    STA     MINBIG
        INR     A
        MOV     B,A
NWLP:   PUSH    B
        CALL    RELL
        POP     B
        DCR     B
        JNZ     NWLP
        CALL    SETRT
        LDA     HUDDRT
        ORI     4
        STA     HUDDRT
        RET
;
; RELL -- let in one large rock of the wave's quota, if any is left
;
RELL:   LDA     WQUOTA
        ORA     A
        RZ
        DCR     A
        STA     WQUOTA
        MVI     A,TOPD
        STA     TOPT
        JMP     SPAWNL
;
; ROCKCK -- count the large and medium rocks; when there are fewer than
; MINBIG, wait TOPT frames, then let in another large rock, or start the
; next wave if the quota is spent. On the title screen there is no
; quota: the rocks just keep coming.
;
ROCKCK: LXI     H,ROCKS
        MVI     B,NROCKS
        MVI     C,0
RCLP:   MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      RCNX
        CALL    GETAUX
        CPI     18
        JC      RCNX
        INR     C
RCNX:   LXI     D,RSZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     RCLP
        LDA     MINBIG
        MOV     B,A
        MOV     A,C
        CMP     B
        RNC
        LXI     H,TOPT
        MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      RC1
        DCR     M
        RET
RC1:    LDA     GSTATE
        ORA     A
        JNZ     RC2
        MVI     A,TOPD
        STA     TOPT
        JMP     SPAWNL
RC2:    LDA     WQUOTA
        ORA     A
        JNZ     RELL
        JMP     NEXTWV
;
; PRESCK -- every PRESSH*256 frames of a wave the rocks that come next
; are faster
;
PRESCK: LHLD    PRESSC
        INX     H
        SHLD    PRESSC
        MOV     A,H
        CPI     PRESSH
        RC
        LXI     H,0
        SHLD    PRESSC
        LDA     PRESS
        CPI     PRESMX
        RNC
        INR     A
        STA     PRESS
        RET
;
; SPAWNL -- one large rock on a random course, on the left edge at least
; 192 pixels above or below the ship, or on the bottom edge at least 256
; pixels to its side
;
SPAWNL: CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     1
        JZ      SL1
        LXI     H,0
        SHLD    NEWXP
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,H             ;DE = 0..382
        ANI     127
        ADD     L
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     A,0
        ADC     A
        MOV     D,A
        LHLD    SHIPR+R_Y
        DAD     D
        LXI     D,192
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,H             ;mod 768 (it is below 1536)
        CPI     3
        JC      SL0
        SUI     3
        MOV     H,A
SL0:    SHLD    NEWYP
        JMP     SL2
SL1:    LXI     H,0
        SHLD    NEWYP
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,H
        ANI     1
        MOV     H,A             ;0..511
        LXI     D,256
        DAD     D
        XCHG
        LHLD    SHIPR+R_X
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,H             ;mod 1024
        ANI     3
        MOV     H,A
        SHLD    NEWXP
SL2:    CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     31
        STA     SPDIR
        XRA     A
;
; NEWROCK -- a rock (A = 0 large, 1 medium, 2 small) at NEWXP,NEWYP
; heading SPDIR, at speed KBASE+WAVE-1+PRESS+0..3 quarter pixels a frame
; (KMED more for a medium one, KSMALL for a small one, KMAX at most).
; Dropped if the table is full.
;
NEWROCK: STA    NRSZ
        CALL    NCLR
        LHLD    NEWXP
        SHLD    NX
        LHLD    NEWYP
        SHLD    NY
        MVI     A,K_ROCK
        STA     NACT
        LDA     WAVE
        ADI     KBASE-1
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     PRESS
        ADD     B
        MOV     B,A
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     3
        ADD     B
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     NRSZ
        ORA     A
        MOV     A,B
        JZ      NRK1
        ADI     KMED
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     NRSZ
        CPI     2
        MOV     A,B
        JC      NRK1
        ADI     KSMALL-KMED
NRK1:   CPI     KMAX
        JC      NRK2
        MVI     A,KMAX
NRK2:   STA     NRK
        LXI     H,DIRV
        LDA     SPDIR
        CALL    TIDX
        CALL    LDW             ;DE = X of the unit vector
        PUSH    H
        LDA     NRK
        CALL    MULK
        SHLD    NVX
        POP     H
        CALL    LDW
        LDA     NRK
        CALL    MULK
        SHLD    NVY
        CALL    RAND            ;which of four shapes and colours
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     3
        STA     NRV
        LXI     H,SHPTBS
        CALL    SZTAB           ;DE = the size's shape table
        LDA     NRV
        ADD     A
        MOV     L,A
        MVI     H,0
        DAD     D
        CALL    LDW
        XCHG
        SHLD    NSHP
        LXI     H,COLTBS
        CALL    SZTAB
        LDA     NRV
        MOV     L,A
        MVI     H,0
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,M
        STA     NCOL
        LDA     NRSZ
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        LXI     H,AUXTB
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,M
        STA     NAUX
        LXI     H,ROCKS
        MVI     B,NROCKS
        JMP     PUTNEW
;
; SZTAB -- DE = word NRSZ of the table at HL
;
SZTAB:  LDA     NRSZ
        ADD     A
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        DAD     D
        JMP     LDW
;
; HITROCK -- the rock at HL is hit: debris and points; a large one leaves
; two medium ones, a medium one three small ones
;
HITROCK: CALL   KILLR           ;OBJ = the rock
        LHLD    OX
        SHLD    NEWXP
        LHLD    OY
        SHLD    NEWYP
        LDA     OCOL
        MVI     B,4
        CALL    SPDEB
        LDA     OAUX
        CPI     30
        JNC     HRL
        CPI     18
        JNC     HRM
        LXI     D,0100H         ;small
        JMP     ADDPTS
HRL:    LXI     D,0020H
        CALL    ADDPTS
        MVI     B,2
        MVI     C,1
        MVI     A,16            ;opposite ways
        JMP     HRSPL
HRM:    LXI     D,0050H
        CALL    ADDPTS
        MVI     B,3
        MVI     C,2
        MVI     A,11            ;a third of a turn apart
HRSPL:  STA     SPSTEP
        MOV     A,C
        STA     SPSZ
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     31
        STA     SPDIR
HRLP:   PUSH    B
        LDA     SPSZ
        CALL    NEWROCK
        LDA     SPSTEP
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     SPDIR
        ADD     B
        ANI     31
        STA     SPDIR
        POP     B
        DCR     B
        JNZ     HRLP
        RET
;
; SPDEB -- B bits of debris in colour A at NEWXP,NEWYP
;
SPDEB:  STA     DCOL
SDLP:   PUSH    B
        CALL    NCLR
        LHLD    NEWXP
        SHLD    NX
        LHLD    NEWYP
        SHLD    NY
        MVI     A,K_DEB
        STA     NACT
        LDA     DCOL
        STA     NCOL
        MVI     A,2
        STA     NAUX
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     7
        ADI     6
        STA     NRK             ;speed 6..13
        MOV     A,H
        ANI     7
        ADI     10
        STA     NLIFE           ;10..17 frames
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     31
        LXI     H,DIRV
        CALL    TIDX
        CALL    LDW
        PUSH    H
        LDA     NRK
        CALL    MULK
        SHLD    NVX
        POP     H
        CALL    LDW
        LDA     NRK
        CALL    MULK
        SHLD    NVY
        LXI     H,DEBR
        MVI     B,NDEBR
        CALL    PUTNEW
        POP     B
        DCR     B
        JNZ     SDLP
        RET
;
;
; ================= the ship =================
;
; SHIPST -- a frame of the ship: turn, thrust, drift, draw, fire. Or,
; when it has been lost, bring the next one in, in the middle, on the
; next frame (after the last one, show GAME OVER DEADF frames on). A new
; ship can't be hit for INVULF frames, or until nothing is within CLRAD
; pixels of it, whichever comes first.
;
SHIPST: LDA     SSTATE
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHALV
        LDA     DEADT
        DCR     A
        JZ      SHDT0
        STA     DEADT
        RET
SHDT0:  LDA     LIVES
        ORA     A
        JZ      GAMEOV
        JMP     SPAWNC
;
SHALV:  LXI     H,SHIPR
        CALL    CPYIN
        CALL    ERASE
        CALL    ERFLAM
        LXI     H,KLEFT         ;turn
        MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHT1
        DCR     M
        LDA     HEAD
        INR     A
        ANI     31
        STA     HEAD
SHT1:   LXI     H,KRIGHT
        MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHT2
        DCR     M
        LDA     HEAD
        DCR     A
        ANI     31
        STA     HEAD
SHT2:   XRA     A               ;thrust
        STA     THRON
        LXI     H,KTHR
        MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHT3
        DCR     M
        MVI     A,1
        STA     THRON
        LXI     H,THRV
        CALL    HIDX
        CALL    LDW
        PUSH    H
        LHLD    OVX
        DAD     D
        SHLD    OVX
        POP     H
        CALL    LDW
        LHLD    OVY
        DAD     D
        SHLD    OVY
SHT3:   LXI     H,OVX
        CALL    FRIC
        LXI     H,OVY
        CALL    FRIC
        CALL    INTEG
        LXI     H,SHIPT         ;the shape for the heading
        LDA     HEAD
        ADD     A
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        DAD     D
        CALL    LDW
        XCHG
        SHLD    OSHP
        MVI     C,CYAN+BRIGHT   ;blue flashes while it can't be hit
        LDA     INVUL
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHT4
        LHLD    OX              ;nothing near: it can be hit again
        SHLD    SX
        LHLD    OY
        SHLD    SY
        CALL    CLEARCK
        MVI     C,CYAN+BRIGHT
        JNC     SHT3A
        LDA     INVUL
        DCR     A
        STA     INVUL
        ANI     4
        JZ      SHT4
        MVI     C,BLUE+BRIGHT
        JMP     SHT4
SHT3A:  XRA     A
        STA     INVUL
SHT4:   MOV     A,C
        STA     OCOL
        CALL    DRAWO
        LDA     THRON           ;the flame, every other frame
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHT5
        LDA     FRAMEC
        ANI     1
        JZ      SHT5
        LXI     H,FLAMET
        LDA     HEAD
        ADD     A
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        DAD     D
        CALL    LDW
        XCHG
        SHLD    FLSHP
        MVI     A,ORANGE+BRIGHT
        CALL    DRAWSH
SHT5:   LDA     FCOOL           ;fire
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHT6
        DCR     A
        STA     FCOOL
SHT6:   LDA     KFIRE
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHT7
        XRA     A
        STA     KFIRE
        LDA     FCOOL
        ORA     A
        CZ      FIRE
SHT7:   JMP     CPYOUT
;
; ERFLAM -- erase the flame, if it is drawn (OBJ = the ship, not moved)
;
ERFLAM: LHLD    FLSHP
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     L
        RZ
        MVI     A,ORANGE+BRIGHT
        CALL    DRAWSH
        LXI     H,0
        SHLD    FLSHP
        RET
;
; FRIC -- the velocity word at HL loses 1/64, and is held to VMAXH
;
FRIC:   PUSH    H
        MOV     E,M
        INX     H
        MOV     D,M             ;DE = v
        MOV     H,D
        MOV     L,E
        DAD     H
        DAD     H               ;H = v/64
        MOV     C,H
        MOV     A,H
        RLC
        SBB     A
        MOV     B,A             ;BC = v/64, sign extended
        MOV     A,E
        SUB     C
        MOV     E,A
        MOV     A,D
        SBB     B
        MOV     D,A             ;DE = v - v/64
        MOV     A,D
        ORA     A
        JM      FRNEG
        CPI     VMAXH
        JC      FRST
        LXI     D,VMAXH*256-1
        JMP     FRST
FRNEG:  CPI     256-VMAXH
        JNC     FRST
        LXI     D,0-VMAXH*256
FRST:   POP     H
        MOV     M,E
        INX     H
        MOV     M,D
        RET
;
; FIRE -- a shot from the nose, at the ship's velocity plus SHOTV
;
FIRE:   LXI     H,PSHOTS
        MVI     B,NPSHOT
        CALL    FINDFR
        RC
        PUSH    H
        CALL    NCLR
        LXI     H,NOSEV
        CALL    HIDX
        CALL    LDW
        PUSH    H
        LHLD    OX
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,H
        ANI     3
        MOV     H,A
        SHLD    NX
        POP     H
        CALL    LDW
        LHLD    OY
        DAD     D
        SHLD    NY
        LXI     H,NY+1
        CALL    WRAPYM
        LXI     H,SHOTV
        CALL    HIDX
        CALL    LDW
        PUSH    H
        LHLD    OVX
        DAD     D
        SHLD    NVX
        POP     H
        CALL    LDW
        LHLD    OVY
        DAD     D
        SHLD    NVY
        MVI     A,K_SHOT
        STA     NACT
        MVI     A,WHITE+BRIGHT
        STA     NCOL
        MVI     A,SHOTL
        STA     NLIFE
        MVI     A,2
        STA     NAUX
        MVI     A,FCOOLV
        STA     FCOOL
        POP     D
        LXI     H,NEWO
        JMP     COPY16
;
; SPAWNC -- a ship in the middle, still, pointing up; SPAWNS -- the same
; at SX,SY
;
SPAWNC: LXI     H,512
        SHLD    SX
        LXI     H,384
        SHLD    SY
SPAWNS: CALL    NCLR
        LHLD    SX
        SHLD    NX
        LHLD    SY
        SHLD    NY
        MVI     A,K_SHIP
        STA     NACT
        LXI     H,SHIP0
        SHLD    NSHP
        MVI     A,CYAN+BRIGHT
        STA     NCOL
        MVI     A,11
        STA     NAUX
        LXI     D,SHIPR
        LXI     H,NEWO
        CALL    COPY16
        XRA     A
        STA     HEAD
        STA     SSTATE
        STA     KTHR
        STA     KLEFT
        STA     KRIGHT
        STA     KFIRE
        STA     FCOOL
        LXI     H,0
        SHLD    FLSHP
        MVI     A,INVULF
        STA     INVUL
        RET
;
; SHIPDIE -- the ship is hit
;
SHIPDIE: LXI     H,SHIPR
        CALL    CPYIN
        CALL    ERASE
        CALL    ERFLAM
        XRA     A
        STA     OACT
        CALL    CPYOUT
        LHLD    OX
        SHLD    NEWXP
        LHLD    OY
        SHLD    NEWYP
        MVI     A,CYAN+BRIGHT
        MVI     B,10
        CALL    SPDEB
        LXI     H,LIVES
        DCR     M
        LDA     HUDDRT
        ORI     2
        STA     HUDDRT
        MVI     A,1
        STA     SSTATE
        MOV     A,M             ;the next ship on the next frame; GAME
        ORA     A               ;OVER DEADF frames on
        MVI     A,1
        JNZ     SHDD
        MVI     A,DEADF
SHDD:   STA     DEADT
        RET
;
; CLEARCK -- CY if a rock, the raider or a raider shot is within CLRAD
; pixels of SX,SY
;
CLEARCK: LXI    H,RAIDR         ;the raider, then its shots: consecutive
        MVI     B,1+NRSHOT
        CALL    CLRLP
        RC
        LXI     H,ROCKS
        MVI     B,NROCKS
CLRLP:
CCLP:   MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      CCNX
        MVI     C,CLRAD
        CALL    HITT
        RC
CCNX:   LXI     D,RSZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     CCLP
        ORA     A
        RET

;
;
; ================= the raider =================
;
; RAIDCK -- count down to the next raider; it starts on the left or
; right edge and crosses the screen
;
RAIDCK: LDA     RAIDR
        ORA     A
        RNZ
        LDA     SSTATE
        ORA     A
        RNZ
        LHLD    RTIMER
        DCX     H
        SHLD    RTIMER
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     L
        RNZ
        CALL    SETRT
        CALL    NCLR
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     1
        LXI     H,RSPDV
        LXI     D,0
        JZ      RK1
        LXI     H,0-RSPDV
        LXI     D,1023
RK1:    SHLD    NVX
        XCHG
        SHLD    NX
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,H
        ANI     1
        MOV     H,A
        LXI     D,100
        DAD     D               ;Y 100..611
        SHLD    NY
        MVI     A,K_RAID
        STA     NACT
        LXI     H,RAIDS
        SHLD    NSHP
        MVI     A,MAGENTA+BRIGHT
        STA     NCOL
        MVI     A,16
        STA     NAUX
        LXI     D,RAIDR
        LXI     H,NEWO
        CALL    COPY16
        LXI     H,RLEFTV
        SHLD    RLEFT
        MVI     A,RTURN
        STA     RTT
        LDA     RFIREV
        STA     RFT
        RET
;
; SETRT -- the frames to the next raider and between its shots, for
; this wave
;
SETRT:  LDA     WAVE
        MOV     B,A
        LXI     H,RTBASE
        LXI     D,0-RTSTEP
SRL:    DCR     B
        JZ      SR2
        JM      SR2
        DAD     D
        JMP     SRL
SR2:    MOV     A,H
        ORA     A
        JM      SR3
        LXI     D,0-RTMIN
        PUSH    H
        DAD     D               ;CY if HL >= RTMIN
        POP     H
        JC      SR4
SR3:    LXI     H,RTMIN
SR4:    SHLD    RTIMER
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     63
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        LHLD    RTIMER
        DAD     D
        SHLD    RTIMER
        LDA     WAVE
        ADD     A
        MOV     B,A
        MVI     A,RFBASE
        SUB     B
        JC      SR5
        CPI     RFMIN
        JNC     SR6
SR5:    MVI     A,RFMIN
SR6:    STA     RFIREV
        RET
;
; RAIDST -- a frame of the raider: drift, now and then change course,
; leave when it has crossed the screen, and fire
;
RAIDST: LDA     RAIDR
        ORA     A
        RZ
        LXI     H,RAIDR
        CALL    CPYIN
        CALL    ERASE
        LHLD    RLEFT
        DCX     H
        SHLD    RLEFT
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     L
        JNZ     RS1
        XRA     A               ;gone
        STA     OACT
        JMP     CPYOUT
RS1:    LXI     H,RTT
        DCR     M
        JNZ     RS2
        MVI     M,RTURN
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     3               ;0, 1 level; 2 up; 3 down
        LXI     H,0
        CPI     2
        JC      RS1A
        LXI     H,RVYV
        JZ      RS1A
        LXI     H,0-RVYV
RS1A:   SHLD    OVY
RS2:    CALL    INTEG
        CALL    DRAWO
        LDA     GSTATE
        ORA     A
        JZ      CPYOUT
        LDA     SSTATE
        ORA     A
        JNZ     CPYOUT
        LXI     H,RFT
        DCR     M
        JNZ     CPYOUT
        LDA     RFIREV
        MOV     M,A
        CALL    RFIRE
        JMP     CPYOUT
;
; RFIRE -- a raider shot (OBJ = the raider), aimed at the ship to 1/128
; of a turn. From wave 2 it aims where the ship will be when the shot
; gets there, if the ship coasts. A random error of up to AIME
; steps either way (3 on wave 1, 2 on wave 2, 1 on waves 3 and 4) is
; gone from wave 5.
;
RFIRE:  LXI     H,RSHOTS
        MVI     B,NRSHOT
        CALL    FINDFR
        RC
        PUSH    H
        LHLD    OX
        XCHG
        LHLD    SHIPR+R_X
        CALL    SUBHD
        SHLD    ADX
        LHLD    OY
        XCHG
        LHLD    SHIPR+R_Y
        CALL    SUBHD
        SHLD    ADY
        LDA     WAVE
        CPI     2
        JC      RFNL
        LHLD    ADX             ;the shot's flight: (|dx|+|dy|)/8 frames,
        CALL    ABSHL           ;60 at most
        XCHG
        LHLD    ADY
        CALL    ABSHL
        DAD     D
        CALL    SRLHL
        CALL    SRLHL
        CALL    SRLHL
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     A
        JNZ     RFT2
        MOV     A,L
        CPI     61
        JC      RFT3
RFT2:   MVI     A,60
RFT3:   MOV     E,A             ;friction: it coasts EFFT[t] frames' worth
        MVI     D,0
        LXI     H,EFFT
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,M
        STA     LEADT
        LHLD    SHIPR+R_VX      ;where the ship will be then
        CALL    LEAD
        XCHG
        LHLD    ADX
        DAD     D
        SHLD    ADX
        LHLD    SHIPR+R_VY
        CALL    LEAD
        XCHG
        LHLD    ADY
        DAD     D
        SHLD    ADY
RFNL:   CALL    ATAN
        MOV     C,A             ;C = the aim, 0..127
        LDA     WAVE            ;B = the error limit
        MVI     B,3
        CPI     2
        JC      RFE
        MVI     B,2
        CPI     3
        JC      RFE
        MVI     B,1
        CPI     5
        JC      RFE
        MVI     B,0
RFE:    MOV     A,B
        ORA     A
        MOV     A,C
        JZ      RFH
        MOV     A,B             ;2B+1 choices
        ADD     A
        INR     A
        MOV     D,A
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ANI     7FH
RFM:    CMP     D               ;A mod (2B+1)
        JC      RFM2
        SUB     D
        JMP     RFM
RFM2:   SUB     B
        ADD     C
        ANI     127
RFH:    STA     SPDIR
        CALL    NCLR
        LHLD    OX
        SHLD    NX
        LHLD    OY
        SHLD    NY
        LXI     H,RSHV
        LDA     SPDIR
        CALL    TIDXW
        CALL    LDW
        XCHG
        SHLD    NVX
        XCHG
        CALL    LDW
        XCHG
        SHLD    NVY
        MVI     A,K_RSH
        STA     NACT
        MVI     A,RED+BRIGHT
        STA     NCOL
        MVI     A,RSHL
        STA     NLIFE
        MVI     A,2
        STA     NAUX
        POP     D
        LXI     H,NEWO
        JMP     COPY16
;
; HITRD -- the raider at HL is hit
;
HITRD:  CALL    KILLR
        LHLD    OX
        SHLD    NEWXP
        LHLD    OY
        SHLD    NEWYP
        MVI     A,MAGENTA+BRIGHT
        MVI     B,8
        JMP     SPDEB
;
; ATAN -- A = the aim (0 up, 128 a turn, CCW) of ADX,ADY
;
ATAN:   LHLD    ADX
        MOV     A,H
        STA     SGNX
        ORA     A
        CM      NEGHL
        SHLD    AAX
        LHLD    ADY
        MOV     A,H
        STA     SGNY
        ORA     A
        CM      NEGHL
ATSC:   MOV     A,H             ;halve both until they are below 1024,
        ANI     0FCH            ;so smaller*64 fits
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     AAX+1
        ANI     0FCH
        ORA     B
        JZ      ATSC2
        CALL    SRLHL
        PUSH    H
        LHLD    AAX
        CALL    SRLHL
        SHLD    AAX
        POP     H
        JMP     ATSC
ATSC2:  XCHG                    ;DE = |dy|
        LHLD    AAX             ;HL = |dx|
        MOV     A,L
        SUB     E
        MOV     A,H
        SBB     D
        MVI     A,0
        JNC     AT1
        MVI     A,1             ;|dy| is the larger
        XCHG
AT1:    STA     AYBIG           ;HL = the larger, DE = the smaller
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     L
        JZ      ATZERO
        SHLD    AMAX
        XCHG
        DAD     H
        DAD     H
        DAD     H
        DAD     H
        DAD     H
        DAD     H
        XCHG                    ;DE = smaller*64
        LHLD    AMAX
        MVI     C,0             ;C = smaller*64/larger, 0..64
ATDL:   MOV     A,E
        SUB     L
        MOV     B,A
        MOV     A,D
        SBB     H
        JC      ATD2
        MOV     D,A
        MOV     E,B
        INR     C
        JMP     ATDL
ATD2:   MOV     E,C
        MVI     D,0
        LXI     H,ATN64
        DAD     D
        MOV     C,M             ;C = the angle from the axis, 0..16
        LDA     SGNX            ;B bit 7: subtract it from the base
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     SGNY
        XRA     B
        ANI     80H
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     AYBIG
        ORA     A
        JZ      ATB1
        MOV     A,B
        XRI     80H
        MOV     B,A
        LDA     SGNY            ;from +Y (32) or -Y (96)
        ORA     A
        MVI     D,32
        JM      ATB2
        JMP     ATB4
ATB2:   MVI     D,96
        JMP     ATB4
ATB1:   LDA     SGNX            ;from +X (0) or -X (64)
        ORA     A
        MVI     D,0
        JM      ATB3
        JMP     ATB4
ATB3:   MVI     D,64
ATB4:   MOV     A,B
        ORA     A
        MOV     A,C
        JM      ATNEG
        ADD     D
        JMP     ATH
ATNEG:  CMA
        INR     A
        ADD     D
ATH:    SUI     32              ;from +X to the aim's 0, up
        ANI     127
        RET
ATZERO: XRA     A
        RET
;
;
; ================= collisions =================
;
; COLLID -- shots against rocks and the raider; the ship against rocks,
; the raider and its shots
;
COLLID: LXI     H,PSHOTS
        MVI     B,NPSHOT
COLP:   MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      COLNX
        PUSH    B
        PUSH    H
        CALL    SETSXY
        CALL    SHOTHT
        POP     H
        POP     B
COLNX:  LXI     D,RSZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     COLP
        LDA     SSTATE
        ORA     A
        RNZ
        LDA     INVUL
        ORA     A
        RNZ
        LXI     H,SHIPR
        CALL    SETSXY
        LXI     H,ROCKS
        MVI     B,NROCKS
CSLP:   MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      CSNX
        CALL    GETAUX
        ADI     4
        MOV     C,A
        CALL    HITT
        JNC     CSNX
        CALL    HITROCK
        JMP     SHIPDIE
CSNX:   LXI     D,RSZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     CSLP
        LXI     H,RAIDR
        MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      CSR
        MVI     C,24
        CALL    HITT
        JNC     CSR
        CALL    HITRD
        JMP     SHIPDIE
CSR:    LXI     H,RSHOTS
        MVI     B,NRSHOT
CRLP:   MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      CRNX
        MVI     C,10
        CALL    HITT
        JNC     CRNX
        CALL    KILLR
        JMP     SHIPDIE
CRNX:   LXI     D,RSZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     CRLP
        RET
;
; SHOTHT -- the shot at HL (its X,Y in SX,SY) against the rocks and the
; raider
;
SHOTHT: SHLD    SHREC
        LXI     H,ROCKS
        MVI     B,NROCKS
SHLP:   MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      SHNX
        CALL    GETAUX
        ADI     2
        MOV     C,A
        CALL    HITT
        JNC     SHNX
        CALL    HITROCK
        LHLD    SHREC
        JMP     KILLR
SHNX:   LXI     D,RSZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     SHLP
        LXI     H,RAIDR
        MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        RZ
        MVI     C,20
        CALL    HITT
        RNC
        CALL    HITRD
        LXI     D,0300H
        CALL    ADDPTS
        LHLD    SHREC
        JMP     KILLR
;
; GETAUX -- A = the radius of the record at HL
;
GETAUX: PUSH    H
        LXI     D,R_AUX
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,M
        POP     H
        RET
;
; SETSXY -- SX,SY = the X,Y of the record at HL (HL kept)
;
SETSXY: PUSH    H
        INX     H
        INX     H
        CALL    LDW
        XCHG
        SHLD    SX
        XCHG
        INX     H
        CALL    LDW
        XCHG
        SHLD    SY
        POP     H
        RET
;
; HITT -- CY if the record at HL is within C pixels of SX,SY on both
; axes. Keeps HL and BC.
;
HITT:   PUSH    H
        INX     H
        INX     H
        MOV     E,M
        INX     H
        MOV     D,M             ;DE = X
        INX     H
        INX     H
        PUSH    H               ;-> Y
        LHLD    SX
        CALL    ABSD
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     A
        JNZ     HTNO2
        MOV     A,L
        CMP     C
        JNC     HTNO2
        POP     H
        MOV     E,M
        INX     H
        MOV     D,M
        LHLD    SY
        CALL    ABSD
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     A
        JNZ     HTNO1
        MOV     A,L
        CMP     C
        POP     H
        RET
HTNO2:  POP     H
HTNO1:  POP     H
        ORA     A
        RET
;
; KILLR -- erase the record at HL and free it. OBJ keeps its copy.
;
KILLR:  CALL    CPYIN
        CALL    ERASE
        XRA     A
        STA     OACT
        JMP     CPYOUT
;
; ADDPTS -- the score += DE (BCD); a ship more at each 10,000
;
ADDPTS: LDA     SCORE+2
        MOV     C,A
        LDA     SCORE
        ADD     E
        DAA
        STA     SCORE
        LDA     SCORE+1
        ADC     D
        DAA
        STA     SCORE+1
        LDA     SCORE+2
        ACI     0
        DAA
        STA     SCORE+2
        CMP     C
        JZ      ADP1
        LDA     LIVES
        CPI     9
        JNC     ADP0
        INR     A
        STA     LIVES
ADP0:   LDA     HUDDRT
        ORI     2
        STA     HUDDRT
ADP1:   LDA     HUDDRT
        ORI     1
        STA     HUDDRT
        RET
;
;
; ================= moving and drawing objects =================
;
; STEPAR -- a frame of every object in the B records at HL: erase,
; count down its life, move and draw. NACTV = how many there were.
;
STEPAR: XRA     A
        STA     NACTV
STPLP:  MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JZ      STPNX
        PUSH    B
        PUSH    H
        LDA     NACTV
        INR     A
        STA     NACTV
        CALL    CPYIN
        CALL    ERASE
        LDA     OLIFE
        ORA     A
        JZ      STPMV
        DCR     A
        STA     OLIFE
        JNZ     STPMV
        XRA     A               ;its time is up: leave it erased
        STA     OACT
        JMP     STPOUT
STPMV:  CALL    INTEG
        CALL    DRAWO
STPOUT: CALL    CPYOUT
        POP     H
        POP     B
STPNX:  LXI     D,RSZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     STPLP
        RET
;
; CPYIN -- the record at HL into OBJ; CPYOUT -- back again
;
CPYIN:  SHLD    RECP
        LXI     D,OBJ
        JMP     COPY16
CPYOUT: LHLD    RECP
        XCHG
        LXI     H,OBJ
;
; COPY16 -- 16 bytes from HL to DE
;
COPY16:
        REPT    16
        MOV     A,M
        STAX    D
        INX     H
        INX     D
        ENDR
        RET
;
; NCLR -- clear NEWO, the record being built
;
NCLR:   LXI     H,NEWO
        MVI     B,RSZ
        XRA     A
NCLP:   MOV     M,A
        INX     H
        DCR     B
        JNZ     NCLP
        RET
;
; FINDFR -- HL = the first free of the B records at HL, NC; CY if none
;
FINDFR: LXI     D,RSZ
FFLP:   MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        RZ
        DAD     D
        DCR     B
        JNZ     FFLP
        STC
        RET
;
; PUTNEW -- NEWO into the first free of the B records at HL (dropped if
; there is none)
;
PUTNEW: CALL    FINDFR
        RC
        XCHG
        LXI     H,NEWO
        JMP     COPY16
;
; INTEG -- OBJ moves one frame, wrapping round the screen
;
INTEG:  LHLD    OVX
        XCHG
        LXI     H,OXF
        CALL    ADDAX
        LDA     OX+1            ;X mod 1024
        ANI     03H
        STA     OX+1
        LHLD    OVY
        XCHG
        LXI     H,OYF
        CALL    ADDAX
        LXI     H,OY+1
;
; WRAPYM -- the Y whose high byte is at HL, mod 768 (0300H)
;
WRAPYM: MOV     A,M
        ORA     A
        JM      WYNEG
        CPI     3
        RC
        SUI     3
        MOV     M,A
        RET
WYNEG:  ADI     3
        MOV     M,A
        RET
;
; ADDAX -- the 16.8 position at HL (fraction first) += DE (8.8)
;
ADDAX:  MOV     A,D
        RLC
        SBB     A
        MOV     B,A             ;the sign of DE
        MOV     A,M
        ADD     E
        MOV     M,A
        INX     H
        MOV     A,M
        ADC     D
        MOV     M,A
        INX     H
        MOV     A,M
        ADC     B
        MOV     M,A
        RET
;
; ERASE -- erase OBJ if it is drawn. DRAWO -- draw it again (XOR: on or
; off), which flips its DRAWN bit.
;
ERASE:  LDA     OACT
        ANI     DRAWN
        RZ
DRAWO:  LDA     OACT
        XRI     DRAWN
        STA     OACT
        LDA     NDRAW
        INR     A
        STA     NDRAW
        LHLD    OSHP
        LDA     OCOL
;
; DRAWSH -- draw shape HL in colour A at OBJ's X,Y, and again across the
; wrap when OBJ is within its radius (+10) of an edge
;
DRAWSH: SHLD    SHPP
        CALL    SETCOL
        LHLD    OY
        XCHG
        LHLD    OX
        CALL    DRAW1
        LDA     OAUX
        CPI     4
        RC
        ADI     10
        STA     GRAD
        XRA     A
        STA     GXF
        STA     GYF
        LDA     GRAD            ;X near 0: +1024; near 1023: -1024
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        LHLD    OX
        MOV     A,L
        SUB     E
        MOV     A,H
        SBB     D
        JNC     DSX2
        LXI     D,1024
        DAD     D
        JMP     DSX3
DSX2:   PUSH    H
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,H
        POP     H
        CPI     4
        JC      DSY
        LXI     D,0-1024
        DAD     D
DSX3:   SHLD    GX
        MVI     A,1
        STA     GXF
DSY:    LDA     GRAD            ;Y near 0: +768; near 767: -768
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        LHLD    OY
        MOV     A,L
        SUB     E
        MOV     A,H
        SBB     D
        JNC     DSY2
        LXI     D,768
        DAD     D
        JMP     DSY3
DSY2:   PUSH    H
        DAD     D
        MOV     A,H
        POP     H
        CPI     3
        JC      DSG
        LXI     D,0-768
        DAD     D
DSY3:   SHLD    GY
        MVI     A,1
        STA     GYF
DSG:    LDA     GXF
        ORA     A
        JZ      DSG2
        LHLD    OY
        XCHG
        LHLD    GX
        CALL    DRAW1
DSG2:   LDA     GYF
        ORA     A
        RZ
        LHLD    GY
        XCHG
        LHLD    OX
        CALL    DRAW1
        LDA     GXF
        ORA     A
        RZ
        LHLD    GY
        XCHG
        LHLD    GX
;
; DRAW1 -- shape SHPP (0: a box) at HL,DE: AMOVE to its first vertex,
; then RPLG with its deltas. Sent with FSEND, a FIFO-load at a time.
;
DRAW1:  PUSH    D
        XCHG
        LHLD    SHPP
        MOV     A,H
        ORA     L
        JZ      DRBOX
        MOV     A,M
        STA     HDRP+1          ;RPLG's n
        ADD     A
        STA     DRN             ;words of deltas
        INX     H
        MOV     C,M             ;BC = the first vertex's X
        INX     H
        MOV     B,M
        INX     H
        XCHG                    ;HL = X, DE -> its Y
        DAD     B
        SHLD    HDRX
        XCHG
        MOV     C,M             ;BC = its Y
        INX     H
        MOV     B,M
        INX     H
        XTHL                    ;HL = Y, the deltas on the stack
        DAD     B
        SHLD    HDRY
        MVI     A,OPRPLG
        MVI     B,5             ;AMOVE X,Y; RPLG n
        CALL    DRHDR
        POP     D
        LDA     DRN
        MOV     B,A
        JMP     FSEND
DRBOX:  POP     H               ;HL = Y, DE = X
        SHLD    HDRY
        XCHG
        SHLD    HDRX
        LXI     H,BOXSZ*256     ;RFRC BOXSZ,BOXSZ (high byte first)
        SHLD    HDRP
        SHLD    HDRP+2
        MVI     A,OPRFRC
        MVI     B,6
;
; DRHDR -- send the B words at HDR: AMOVE HDRX,HDRY, then command A in
; the drawing mode with the parameters at HDRP. HDRX and HDRY are
; stored the Intel way and swapped here.
;
DRHDR:  STA     HDRC
        LDA     CZDM
        STA     HDRC+1
        LHLD    HDRX
        MOV     A,H
        MOV     H,L
        MOV     L,A
        SHLD    HDRX
        LHLD    HDRY
        MOV     A,H
        MOV     H,L
        MOV     L,A
        SHLD    HDRY
        CALL    CZSYNC
        LXI     D,HDR
;
; FSEND -- send B words (high byte first) from DE to the ACRTC's write
; FIFO: wait until it is empty, then put in up to 8 words, its depth,
; without looking, and again. Much faster than a CZPUTW each.
;
FSEND:  MOV     A,B
        CPI     9
        JC      FS1
        MVI     A,8
FS1:    MOV     C,A             ;C = words this time
        ADD     A
        ADD     A
        ADD     A
        CMA
        INR     A
        MOV     L,A
        MVI     H,0FFH          ;HL = -8C
        PUSH    D
        LXI     D,FSBEND
        DAD     D               ;into FSBLK, 2C units before its end
        POP     D
        CALL    FSWAIT
        PCHL
FSRET:  MOV     A,B
        SUB     C
        MOV     B,A
        JNZ     FSEND
        RET
;
; SETCOL -- the drawing colour A, unless it is already
;
SETCOL: PUSH    H
        LXI     H,LCOL
        CMP     M
        POP     H
        RZ
        STA     LCOL
        JMP     CZCOL
;
;
; ================= the overlay: score, ships, messages =================
;
; OVON1 -- draw on the overlay, in replace mode, bits on; OVOFF1 -- back
; to the XOR playfield
;
OVON1:  GOVL
        GMODE   0
        GCOLOR  OVSET
        GBCOL   OVCLR
        RET
OVOFF1: GFRAME
        GMODE   OMEOR+AMCLIP
        MVI     A,1
        STA     LCOL
        RET
;
; HUDUPD -- redraw what HUDDRT says changed: 1 score, 2 ships, 4 wave,
; 8 high score
;
HUDUPD: LDA     HUDDRT
        ORA     A
        RZ
        CALL    OVON1
        GTATTR  2,0,TXOPAQ
        LDA     HUDDRT
        ANI     1
        JZ      HU2
        GTPOS   24,738
        LXI     H,SCORE
        CALL    BCD6
        LXI     H,NUMBUF
        MVI     B,6
        GTSTR
HU2:    LDA     HUDDRT
        ANI     8
        JZ      HU3
        GTPOS   400,738
        GTEXT   "HI "
        LXI     H,HISC
        CALL    BCD6
        LXI     H,NUMBUF
        MVI     B,6
        GTSTR
HU3:    LDA     HUDDRT
        ANI     4
        JZ      HU4
        GTPOS   820,738
        GTEXT   "WAVE "
        LDA     WAVE
        CALL    DEC2
        LXI     H,NUMBUF
        MVI     B,2
        GTSTR
HU4:    LDA     HUDDRT
        ANI     2
        CNZ     LIVDRW
        XRA     A
        STA     HUDDRT
        JMP     OVOFF1
;
; LIVDRW -- a small ship for each one left
;
LIVDRW: GCOLOR  OVCLR
        GMOVE   20,694
        GFRECT  220,730
        GCOLOR  OVSET
        LDA     LIVES
        ORA     A
        RZ
        MOV     B,A
        LXI     H,LIFEIC
        SHLD    SHPP
        LXI     H,32
LVLP:   PUSH    B
        PUSH    H
        LXI     D,712
        CALL    DRAW1
        POP     H
        LXI     D,22
        DAD     D
        POP     B
        DCR     B
        JNZ     LVLP
        RET
;
; BCD6 -- NUMBUF = the 6-digit BCD number at HL (low byte first)
;
BCD6:   INX     H
        INX     H
        LXI     D,NUMBUF
        MVI     B,3
BCLP:   MOV     A,M
        RRC
        RRC
        RRC
        RRC
        ANI     0FH
        ADI     '0'
        STAX    D
        INX     D
        MOV     A,M
        ANI     0FH
        ADI     '0'
        STAX    D
        INX     D
        DCX     H
        DCR     B
        JNZ     BCLP
        RET
;
; DEC2 -- NUMBUF = A (0..99) as two digits
;
DEC2:   MVI     B,'0'
D2LP:   CPI     10
        JC      D2X
        SUI     10
        INR     B
        JMP     D2LP
D2X:    ADI     '0'
        STA     NUMBUF+1
        MOV     A,B
        STA     NUMBUF
        RET
;
;
; ================= small helpers =================
;
LDW:    MOV     E,M             ;DE = word at HL, HL += 2
        INX     H
        MOV     D,M
        INX     H
        RET
;
NEGHL:  MOV     A,L
        CMA
        MOV     L,A
        MOV     A,H
        CMA
        MOV     H,A
        INX     H
        RET
;
SUBHD:  MOV     A,L             ;HL = HL - DE
        SUB     E
        MOV     L,A
        MOV     A,H
        SBB     D
        MOV     H,A
        RET
;
ABSD:   CALL    SUBHD           ;HL = |HL - DE|
        ORA     A
        JM      NEGHL
        RET
;
; ABSHL -- HL = |HL|
;
ABSHL:  MOV     A,H
        ORA     A
        JM      NEGHL
        RET
;
; SRLHL -- HL = HL/2, unsigned; SRAHL -- HL = HL/2, signed
;
SRLHL:  ORA     A
        MOV     A,H
        RAR
        MOV     H,A
        MOV     A,L
        RAR
        MOV     L,A
        RET
;
SRAHL:  MOV     A,H
        RAL
        MOV     A,H
        RAR
        MOV     H,A
        MOV     A,L
        RAR
        MOV     L,A
        RET
;
; LEAD -- HL = the 8.8 velocity HL times LEADT frames, in pixels:
; (HL/4 * LEADT)/64, so it can't overflow
;
LEAD:   CALL    SRAHL
        CALL    SRAHL
        XCHG
        LDA     LEADT
        CALL    MULK
        MVI     B,6
LDL:    CALL    SRAHL
        DCR     B
        JNZ     LDL
        RET
;
; TIDXW -- HL = &table[A], 4 bytes an entry, A up to 255
;
TIDXW:  MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        XCHG
        DAD     H
        DAD     H
        DAD     D
        RET
;
; HIDX -- HL = &table[HEAD], 4 bytes an entry; TIDX -- &table[A]
;
HIDX:   LDA     HEAD
TIDX:   ADD     A
        ADD     A
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     D,0
        DAD     D
        RET
;
; MULK -- HL = DE * A (A small, DE signed)
;
MULK:   LXI     H,0
        ORA     A
        RZ
MKLP:   DAD     D
        DCR     A
        JNZ     MKLP
        RET
;
; RAND -- 16-bit xorshift (7,9,8): SEED = next value, returned in HL.
; Preserves BC, DE.
;
RAND:   LHLD    SEED
        MOV     A,H             ;x ^= x << 7
        RAR
        MOV     A,L
        RAR
        XRA     H
        MOV     H,A
        MOV     A,L
        RAR
        MOV     A,H
        RAR
        XRA     L
        MOV     L,A             ;x ^= x >> 9
        XRA     H               ;x ^= x << 8
        MOV     H,A
        SHLD    SEED
        RET
;
; RANDY -- DE = a random Y, 0..766. Keeps HL, BC.
;
RANDY:  PUSH    H
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,H
        ANI     1
        MOV     D,A
        MOV     E,L             ;0..511
        CALL    RAND
        MOV     A,L
        ADD     E
        MOV     E,A
        MVI     A,0
        ADC     D
        MOV     D,A             ;+0..255
        POP     H
        RET
;
; ================= the ACRTC ports (FSEND's own) =================
;
; On the real board the opcode fetched after an IN or OUT to the ACRTC
; must have A1 = 0 after port 70H (ACRSR) and A1 = 1 after 72H (ACRDAT),
; as cz88gfx 1.5's CZPORT does it: an ACRSR access at an address 2 or 3
; mod 4, an ACRDAT one at 0 or 1. Only these two routines touch them.
;
; FSWAIT -- wait until the write FIFO is empty
;
        ALIGN   4
        DEFS    2
FSWAIT: IN      ACRSR           ;2      next 0
        ANI     SRWFE           ;0
        JZ      FSWAIT          ;1
        RET
;
; FSBLK -- 16 bytes from DE to the FIFO; FSEND enters 2 units of 4
; bytes a word before the end
;
        ALIGN   4
        DEFS    3
FSBLK:
        REPT    16
        LDAX    D               ;3
        OUT     ACRDAT          ;0      next 2
        INX     D               ;2
        ENDR
FSBEND: JMP     FSRET
;
;
; ================= data =================
;
MSGHI:  DB      "ROCKFALL -- W thrust, A/D turn, space fire, P pause, Q quit",CR,LF,"$"
MSGBYE: DB      "ROCKFALL over.",CR,LF,"$"
;
STARC:  DB      BLUE+16,WHITE+12,CYAN+14,BLUE+24
LCOLS:  DB      ORANGE+31,ORANGE+24,ORANGE+28,YELLOW+22
MCOLS:  DB      RED+31,RED+24,MAGENTA+24,RED+28
SCOLS:  DB      YELLOW+31,YELLOW+22,WHITE+24,GREEN+24
SHPTBS: DW      ROCKLT,ROCKMT,ROCKST    ;by size: large, medium, small
COLTBS: DW      LCOLS,MCOLS,SCOLS
AUXTB:  DB      36,22,13                ;radii
;
        INCLUDE "RFTAB.INC"
;
SEED:   DW      0ACE1H
LCOL:   DB      1               ;the colour last set (1: none, never used)
HISC:   DB      0,0,0           ;high score, BCD, low byte first
;
OLDSP:  DS      2
FRAMEC: DS      2
GSTATE: DS      1               ;0 title/game over, 1 playing
SSTATE: DS      1               ;0 ship flying, 1 lost (DEADT counting)
DEADT:  DS      1
LIVES:  DS      1
WAVE:   DS      1
WQUOTA: DS      1               ;large rocks still to come this wave
MINBIG: DS      1               ;large and medium rocks kept in play
TOPT:   DS      1               ;frames to the next one
PRESS:  DS      1
PRESSC: DS      2
NACTV:  DS      1
NDRAW:  DS      1
KCNT:   DS      1
KTHR:   DS      1               ;hold counts
KLEFT:  DS      1
KRIGHT: DS      1
KFIRE:  DS      1
FCOOL:  DS      1
HEAD:   DS      1               ;0..31, 0 up, CCW
THRON:  DS      1
INVUL:  DS      1
FLSHP:  DS      2               ;the flame shape drawn, 0 none
SCORE:  DS      3               ;BCD, low byte first
HUDDRT: DS      1
NUMBUF: DS      6
RLEFT:  DS      2               ;raider: frames left to cross
RTT:    DS      1               ;frames to its next turn
RFT:    DS      1               ;frames to its next shot
RFIREV: DS      1               ;frames between its shots
RTIMER: DS      2               ;frames to the next raider
SHPP:   DS      2               ;DRAWSH/DRAW1
DRN:    DS      1
HDR:    DB      80H,0           ;AMOVE
HDRX:   DS      2
HDRY:   DS      2
HDRC:   DS      2               ;RPLG n, or RFRC dX,dY
HDRP:   DS      4
GRAD:   DS      1
GXF:    DS      1
GYF:    DS      1
GX:     DS      2
GY:     DS      2
RECP:   DS      2               ;CPYIN's record
SX:     DS      2               ;HITT's point
SY:     DS      2
SHREC:  DS      2
NEWXP:  DS      2               ;NEWROCK, SPDEB: where
NEWYP:  DS      2
SPDIR:  DS      1               ;NEWROCK, RFIRE: which way
NRSZ:   DS      1
NRK:    DS      1
NRV:    DS      1
SPSTEP: DS      1               ;HITROCK
SPSZ:   DS      1
LEADT:  DS      1               ;RFIRE
DCOL:   DS      1
ADX:    DS      2               ;ATAN
ADY:    DS      2
AAX:    DS      2
AMAX:   DS      2
SGNX:   DS      1
SGNY:   DS      1
AYBIG:  DS      1
;
; OBJ -- the record being worked on (CPYIN/CPYOUT)
;
OBJ:
OACT:   DS      1
OXF:    DS      1
OX:     DS      2
OYF:    DS      1
OY:     DS      2
OVX:    DS      2
OVY:    DS      2
OSHP:   DS      2
OCOL:   DS      1
OLIFE:  DS      1
OAUX:   DS      1
;
; NEWO -- a record being built (NCLR, then PUTNEW or COPY16)
;
NEWO:
NACT:   DS      1
NXF:    DS      1
NX:     DS      2
NYF:    DS      1
NY:     DS      2
NVX:    DS      2
NVY:    DS      2
NSHP:   DS      2
NCOL:   DS      1
NLIFE:  DS      1
NAUX:   DS      1
;
ARRBEG:
SHIPR:  DS      RSZ
RAIDR:  DS      RSZ
RSHOTS: DS      RSZ*NRSHOT      ;straight after RAIDR (CLEARCK)
PSHOTS: DS      RSZ*NPSHOT
ROCKS:  DS      RSZ*NROCKS
DEBR:   DS      RSZ*NDEBR
ARREND:
        DS      128
STACK:
